Hi Heather, indeed the dimensionality behavior of those two syntaxes is different. It's noted in the documentation <https://r-nimble.org/html_manual/cha-progr-with-models.html#getting-and-setting-variable-and-node-values>, but not all that easy to find (and I see the documentation has a typo in the key sentence about this that I'll make a note for us to fix). I don't remember off-hand why the behavior is different.

-chris

